                <h4>How Scoring Actually Works — and the Time Math That Follows</h4>
                <p>The CKA is scored by <strong>automated grading of the end state</strong>, not by watching how you got there. Each task carries a weight; <strong>partial credit is real</strong> (a task with three checks can earn ⅓ or ⅔). You need <strong>66%</strong> overall. Two consequences shape your entire strategy:</p>
                <div class="card-grid cols-2">
