                        <p>~15–20 tasks in 120 minutes ≈ <strong>6–8 min/task</strong>. To clear 66% you can afford to <em>completely miss about ⅓ of the weight</em> — so never sink 25 minutes into one hard task while three quick ones sit undone.</p>
