                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                        <p><strong>Check yourself:</strong> you mapped four raw error strings straight to a pipeline stage and a chapter — no guessing. That "read the error → name the stage" habit is one of the highest-leverage troubleshooting skills on the whole exam.</p>
