                <div class="info-box note">
                    <h5>📖 The mental shortcut</h5>
                    <p>For the rest of your CKA life, sort every problem into one bucket: is it a <strong>decision</strong> problem (control plane — won't schedule, won't reconcile, can't reach the API) or a <strong>run</strong> problem (a node — container won't start, NotReady, networking)? That single split routes you to the right component before you type a command.</p>
