                <p>Notice the layer numbering matches this chapter's own domain map almost exactly: Layer 0 is the Cloud ring from §1.2's 4Cs; Layers 1-3 (Cluster Access, Network, Pod Admission) are the Cluster ring; Layers 4-5 (Container Hardening, Kernel Isolation) are the Container ring; and Layers 6-7 (Runtime Detection, Response) are where the Code ring's supply-chain work pays off at runtime — a signed, scanned image is exactly what gives Falco and the audit log something trustworthy to alert on. The two models are not competitors; the Onion Model is the 4Cs replayed as a single ordered attack chain instead of four independent rings.</p>

