                        <tr><td>ResourceQuotas + LimitRanges</td><td>Fairly allocate shared resources; ensure every Pod declares its requirements</td><td>Ch 24</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Node isolation for different trust contexts</td><td>Pods with different trust levels run on separate node sets</td><td>Ch 13, 21</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>A container runtime with security restrictions</td><td>containerd/CRI-O configuration hardening, or a sandboxed runtime for less-trusted workloads</td><td>Ch 13, 21</td></tr>
