                <h4>Defense-in-Depth: The 5-Layer Architecture Model</h4>
                <p>The CKS curriculum is structured as concentric layers of defense. Each layer independently stops attacks — if an attacker bypasses one layer, the next layer catches them. This is <strong>defense-in-depth</strong>, and it's the architectural principle behind every CKS control you will learn:</p>
