            <span class="ch-jump" id="cks-ch3-drill"></span>
            <div class="cka-practice-drill">
                <h4>🔬 Practice Drill 3.1 — Sketch the 5 Gates From Memory</h4>
                <div class="drill-timer">⏱️ Target Time: 5 minutes</div>
                <div class="drill-scenario">
                    <h5>Scenario</h5>
                    <p>In <strong>5 minutes, from memory</strong>, sketch the 5 security gates a <code>kubectl apply</code> passes through, in order, and label: which component owns each gate, what the failure HTTP code/signal is, and which CKS chapter fixes it. Then circle the ONE gate that a read-only <code>kubectl get pods</code> skips entirely.</p>
