                        </table>
                        <p><strong>Check yourself:</strong> if you correctly circled Gate 4 (both 4a and 4b) as the one a GET/LIST skips, and you can say out loud "a plain 403 is Gate 3, a 403 with a policy message is Gate 4b" without hesitating, you have this chapter's core mental model cold.</p>
