                <h3 class="section-h">4.6 Top 10 CIS Failures — Exact Exam Fixes</h3>
                <p>The CKS exam tests <strong>CIS benchmark review of Kubernetes components (etcd, kubelet, kubedns, kubeapi)</strong>. This table folds together cks.txt's canonical top-10 most-tested CIS failures — they appear at rows 1, 2, 4, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, and 14 below — with 4 additional checks (rows 3, 5, 6, and 7: <code>encryption-provider-config</code>, the <code>ServiceAccount</code> admission plugin, and etcd's cert-file/client-cert-auth pair) that show up on almost every real-world kube-bench run just as often and round out the picture:</p>
