                    <li>podSelector + namespaceSelector in the SAME from entry = AND. Separate from entries = OR.</li>
                    <li>Use <code>kubectl run netshoot --image=nicolaka/netshoot --rm -it -- /bin/bash</code> for quick connectivity testing. It has curl, nc, nslookup, and more.</li>
