            <div class="visual-summary">
                <div class="diagram-title">⚡ Ch 6 Visual Cheat Sheet — Network Policies</div>
                <div class="card-grid cols-4">
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🚫</div><h5>Deny All</h5><p>Start with <code>podSelector: {}</code> + no rules. Blocks all traffic. Then add allows.</p></div>
