                    <p class="mb-0">Six things to know cold: start every task with deny-all; podSelector+namespaceSelector in the same <code>from</code> entry is AND logic, separate entries are OR; only Calico/Cilium/Weave-class CNIs enforce NetworkPolicy at all; a deny-all egress policy silently breaks DNS unless you add a UDP/TCP 53 rule to kube-dns; test every policy with a <code>nicolaka/netshoot</code> pod and <code>nc -zv</code>; and remember NetworkPolicy only filters IP/port (L3/L4) — identity-based traffic control needs a service mesh like Istio.</p>
