            <span class="ch-jump" id="ch11-cheatsheet"></span>
            <div class="visual-summary">
                <div class="diagram-title">⚡ Ch 11 Visual Cheat Sheet — Node Restriction</div>
                <div class="card-grid cols-4">
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🔐</div><h5>Node Authorizer</h5><p>Gate 2. Allows kubelet to READ its own node, pods, secrets. Authorization mode.</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🚫</div><h5>NodeRestriction</h5><p>Gate 4. Limits kubelet to MODIFY only its OWN node + assigned pods. Admission plugin.</p></div>
