            <section class="section-block" id="s12-3">
                <h3 class="section-h">12.3 Security Patches vs Minor Upgrades</h3>
                <p>Not all upgrades are equal. Understanding the difference between a <strong>patch release</strong> (security fix) and a <strong>minor release</strong> (new features) determines your response timeline:</p>

                <h4>Patch vs Minor — When to Act</h4>
                <div class="split-panel">
                    <div class="panel-left">
                        <h5>🔴 PATCH RELEASE (1.29.0 → 1.29.5)</h5>
                        <div class="process-steps">
                            <div class="step"><span class="step-num">⏰</span> Security fixes + bug fixes only</div>
                            <div class="step"><span class="step-num">📅</span> Released every 4-6 weeks</div>
                            <div class="step"><span class="step-num">🚨</span> ACTION: Apply IMMEDIATELY when CVE is in release notes</div>
                            <div class="step"><span class="step-num">✅</span> No breaking changes — safe to apply directly</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="panel-right">
                        <h5>🟡 MINOR RELEASE (1.28 → 1.29)</h5>
                        <div class="process-steps">
                            <div class="step"><span class="step-num">⏰</span> New features + API changes + deprecations</div>
                            <div class="step"><span class="step-num">📅</span> Released every ~4 months</div>
                            <div class="step"><span class="step-num">🧪</span> ACTION: Test in staging → upgrade within 6-8 months</div>
                            <div class="step"><span class="step-num">⚠️</span> May have breaking changes — read release notes carefully</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h4>Kubernetes Release Cycle — Strategic Timeline</h4>
                <div class="diagram-container">
                    <div class="diagram-title">When each type of release happens and how you should respond</div>
<pre>
