            </div>
            </div><!-- /chapter-intro -->

            <div class="learning-objectives">
                <h4>🎯 What You'll Learn</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>✅ Why the node OS is the last line of defense — and what happens when it fails</li>
                    <li>✅ How to audit and remove unnecessary services, packages, and daemons from every node</li>
                    <li>✅ How to lock down open ports with firewall rules — exposing ONLY what Kubernetes requires</li>
                    <li>✅ How to harden SSH, create dedicated admin users, and eliminate shared root access</li>
                    <li>✅ How to verify every hardening step against the CIS Linux Benchmark</li>
                    <li>✅ How to apply OS hardening to the easypj/jobpost cluster nodes</li>
