                <h4>Compliant easypj Pod Spec for Restricted Level</h4>
                <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                    <div class="code-block-header">
                        <span class="code-lang">YAML — easypj Django deployment compliant with PSS Restricted</span>
                    </div>
                    <pre><code class="language-yaml">apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: easypj-django
  namespace: easypj-prod  # ← This namespace has enforce=restricted
