                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🔧</div><h5>19.2 — Setup</h5><p><strong>Generate:</strong> 32-byte key<br><strong>Configure:</strong> EncryptionConfiguration YAML<br><strong>Flag:</strong> --encryption-provider-config<br><strong>Rotate:</strong> kubectl replace all Secrets</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🔐</div><h5>19.3 — Providers</h5><p><strong>Recommended:</strong> aesgcm/secretbox<br><strong>Enterprise:</strong> kms (envelope encryption)<br><strong>Fallback:</strong> identity (plaintext — unsafe)</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🏗️</div><h5>19.4 — easypj Practices</h5><p><strong>DB creds + Django SECRET_KEY:</strong> separate Secrets<br><strong>Inject:</strong> envFrom secretRef<br><strong>Audit:</strong> kubectl auth can-i get secrets</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🔄</div><h5>19.5 — Rotation Patterns</h5><p><strong>Delete+recreate:</strong> SA tokens, API keys<br><strong>In-place update:</strong> DB passwords, TLS certs<br><strong>Key rotation:</strong> etcd encryption keys</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🥇</div><h5>19.6 — Provider Order</h5><p><strong>Write:</strong> ALWAYS provider 1<br><strong>Read:</strong> try in order until success<br><strong>identity:</strong> LAST only, never first</p></div>
                </div>

                <div class="diagram-container">
                    <div class="diagram-title">Chapter 19 End-to-End — From Plaintext etcd to a Fully-Rotated, Correctly-Ordered EncryptionConfiguration</div>
<pre>
  19.1 PROBLEM          19.2 ENABLE              19.3 CHOOSE            19.6 ORDER RULE
  base64 in etcd    →   generate key,       →    aesgcm/secretbox   →   first = write
  = zero security        write config,            or kms (best);         every = read (in order)
                          mount + flag,             identity = plain      identity NEVER first
                          rotate ALL secrets

                                    │                                          │
                                    ▼                                          ▼
                     19.4 APPLY TO easypj                      19.5 KEEP IT ROTATING
