  │   • A CVE may be "fixed" in Debian but still "open" in Alpine            │
  │                                                                           │
  │   Database location: ~/.cache/trivy/db/ (refreshed every 6 hours)         │
  │   Skip update: --skip-db-update (offline/air-gapped environments)         │
