            <span class="ch-jump" id="ch24-cheatsheet"></span>
            <div class="visual-summary">
                <div class="diagram-title">⚡ Ch 24 Visual Cheat Sheet — Admission Controllers</div>
                <div class="card-grid cols-3">
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🔀</div><h5>Mutating</h5><p>Runs FIRST. Can MODIFY request. Inject sidecars, add defaults.</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">✅</div><h5>Validating</h5><p>Runs SECOND. ACCEPT or REJECT. OPA/Gatekeeper, Kyverno.</p></div>
