                <h4>Gate Summary — What Each Tool Catches and Where</h4>
                <div class="comparison-table">
                    <table>
                        <thead><tr><th>Gate</th><th>Tool</th><th>Runs On</th><th>Blocks If</th><th>What It Catches</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr><td><strong>Gate 1</strong></td><td>kube-linter</td><td>Every PR</td><td>Any check fails</td><td>Privileged containers, hostNetwork, missing securityContext, latest tags</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>Gate 1</strong></td><td>kubesec</td><td>Every PR</td><td>Score &lt; 4</td><td>Overall security posture scoring</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>Gate 1</strong></td><td>conftest</td><td>Every PR</td><td>Any deny rule triggers</td><td>Organization-specific policies (labels, naming, structure)</td></tr>
