                            <tr><td><strong>VEX support</strong></td><td>✅ Native VEX integration</td><td>✅ VEX extension</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>CKS exam</strong></td><td>✅ Know it exists, syft -o spdx-json</td><td>⚠️ Know it as an alternative format</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

