                <h4>Automated SBOM Generation in CI/CD Pipeline</h4>
                <div class="diagram-container">
                    <div class="diagram-title">SBOM Generation Pipeline for the easypj Django App</div>
<pre>
 1. Checkout code
 2. Build Docker image: easypj/api:v2.1.0
 3. Generate SBOM BEFORE pushing:
    $ syft easypj/api:v2.1.0 -o spdx-json > sbom.spdx.json
    $ trivy image --format cyclonedx --output sbom.cdx.json easypj/api:v2.1.0
 4. Sign SBOM:
    $ cosign sign-blob --key cosign.key sbom.spdx.json
 5. Push image:
    $ docker push easypj/api:v2.1.0
 6. Attach SBOM as OCI artifact:
    $ cosign attach sbom --sbom sbom.spdx.json easypj/api:v2.1.0
 7. Sign image:
    $ cosign sign --key cosign.key easypj/api:v2.1.0
 8. Upload SBOM to Dependency-Track for continuous monitoring

 RESULT: Image is signed + SBOM-attached + monitored forever
 QUERY:  cosign download sbom easypj/api:v2.1.0 | jq .
</pre>
