                <div class="info-box tip"><h5>💡 CKS Exam: Supply Chain</h5><p>Key supply chain controls: (1) Only push signed images (<code>cosign sign</code> in CI). (2) Repository enforces tag immutability. (3) Admission controller verifies signature before deployment. (4) SBOM generated at build, attached to image. (5) Periodic re-scanning of stored images for newly discovered CVEs.</p></div>
