                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">⚙️</div><h5>Policy Config (28.2)</h5><p><strong>4 levels + first-match-wins.</strong> Decision tree for level selection. Suppress system noise. Secrets/RBAC/exec at RequestResponse. Log rotation: maxage/maxsize/maxbackup.</p></div>
