            <div class="learning-objectives">
                <h4>🎯 What You'll Learn — Core-Level Mastery</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>✅ <strong>Continuous image scanning with Trivy Operator:</strong> Automatic CVE detection across all namespaces, vulnerability reports as CRDs, alerting on new CRITICAL CVEs</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>Scheduled security benchmarking:</strong> Running kube-bench as a Kubernetes CronJob, detecting configuration drift from CIS benchmarks</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>Policy compliance auditing:</strong> OPA/Gatekeeper audit mode — finding existing violations without blocking workloads, constraint violation reporting</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>Security dashboards &amp; SLIs:</strong> Exposing security metrics to Prometheus, Grafana dashboards for CVE counts/policy violations/Falco alerts, security SLOs</li>
