                <h4>How kubesec Calculates Its Score — Understanding the 2/10 to 8/10 Jump</h4>
                <div class="comparison-table">
                    <table>
                        <thead><tr><th>Check</th><th>Weight</th><th>Before (2/10)</th><th>After (8/10)</th><th>Scoring Logic</th></tr></thead>
