            <section class="section-block" id="s34-4">
                <h3 class="section-h">34.4 Post-Incident — Strengthening the Security Posture</h3>
                <p>Every incident exposes gaps. The post-incident phase <strong>closes those gaps</strong> so the same attack can't succeed again. Based on the 3 gaps identified in Section 34.2, here are the concrete hardening actions:</p>

                <h4>Gap 1: NetworkPolicy Allowed DB Access → Tighten Egress Rules</h4>
                <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                    <div class="code-block-header">
                        <span class="code-lang">YAML — Updated NetworkPolicy: Block easypj outbound except postgres + redis (NO external)</span>
                    </div>
                    <pre><code class="language-yaml">---
