                <h4>🔑 Key Takeaways</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>GitOps principle:</strong> Git is the single source of truth. Every security change goes through PR review → CI validation → ArgoCD deployment — never a direct <code>kubectl apply</code> from a laptop.</li>
                    <li><strong>Self-healing is the security-critical setting:</strong> <code>syncPolicy.automated.selfHeal: true</code> auto-corrects manual <code>kubectl edit</code> changes within 3 minutes, turning GitOps from "deploy from Git" into "enforce Git as the only source of truth."</li>
