                <div class="card-grid cols-3">
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🔐</div><h5>Encryption Tasks</h5><p>Create <code>/etc/kubernetes/encryption-config.yaml</code> → Edit <code>/etc/kubernetes/manifests/kube-apiserver.yaml</code> → Add <code>--encryption-provider-config</code> flag + volume mount → Verify with <code>etcdctl get</code></p></div>
