                <h4>Task B: Add Full Security Context to Pod (Non-Root, Drop ALL Caps)</h4>
                <div class="scenario-box">
                    <div class="scenario-header"><span class="scenario-badge info">TASK</span><span class="scenario-title">Context: mk8s-cluster-4 | Time: 8 min | Points: 7</span></div>
                    <div class="scenario-steps">
                        <div class="scenario-step"><div class="step-marker">📋</div><div class="step-content"><strong>Objective:</strong> Create a pod with the full CKS security context: non-root, read-only filesystem, drop ALL capabilities, privilege escalation disabled. Verify each control is active.</div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                    <div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-lang">✅ Solution</span></div>
                    <pre><code class="language-bash"># Step 1: Create hardened pod
cat &lt;&lt;EOF | kubectl apply -f -
apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: hardened-app
spec:
  securityContext:
    runAsNonRoot: true
    runAsUser: 1000
    runAsGroup: 1000
    fsGroup: 1000
    seccompProfile:
      type: RuntimeDefault
  containers:
  - name: app
    image: nginx:alpine
    securityContext:
      allowPrivilegeEscalation: false
      readOnlyRootFilesystem: true
      capabilities:
        drop: ["ALL"]
