                <h4>RBAC Inspection and Verification</h4>
                <div class="comparison-table">
                    <table>
                        <thead><tr><th style="width:8%;">⚡</th><th style="width:35%;">Command</th><th style="width:30%;">What It Does</th><th style="width:27%;">Example</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr><td>⚡</td><td><code>kubectl auth can-i &lt;verb&gt; &lt;resource&gt; -n &lt;ns&gt;</code></td><td>Check if YOU can perform an action</td><td><code>kubectl auth can-i create pods -n easypj-prod</code></td></tr>
                            <tr><td>⚡</td><td><code>kubectl auth can-i &lt;verb&gt; &lt;resource&gt; --as=&lt;user&gt; -n &lt;ns&gt;</code></td><td>Check if ANOTHER user/SA can perform an action</td><td><code>kubectl auth can-i get secrets --as=system:serviceaccount:easypj-prod:easypj-sa -n easypj-prod</code></td></tr>
