                            <tr><td></td><td><code>kubectl describe clusterrole &lt;name&gt;</code></td><td>Show detailed rules for a ClusterRole</td><td><code>kubectl describe clusterrole cluster-admin</code></td></tr>
                            <tr><td></td><td><code>kubectl get clusterrolebindings -o json | jq '.items[] | select(.subjects[]?.name=="&lt;sa&gt;")'</code></td><td>Find all ClusterRoleBindings for a SA</td><td><code>kubectl get clusterrolebindings -o json | jq '.items[] | select(.subjects[]?.name=="default")'</code></td></tr>
