                <div class="info-box tip">
                    <h5>💡 CKS Exam Tip — RBAC Speed Shortcuts</h5>
                    <p><strong>Never write RBAC YAML from scratch.</strong> Use <code>kubectl create role ... --dry-run=client -o yaml > role.yaml</code> to generate the YAML, then edit it. This is 3× faster and avoids YAML syntax errors. For the exam, <code>kubectl auth can-i --as=...</code> is your primary verification tool — run it after every RBAC task to confirm your bindings work before moving on.</p>
