            <section class="section-block" id="sa-3">
                <h3 class="section-h">A.3 Network Security Commands</h3>
                <p>NetworkPolicy management and connectivity testing. <strong>The CKS exam expects you to create, apply, and verify NetworkPolicies from scratch.</strong></p>

                <div class="comparison-table">
                    <table>
                        <thead><tr><th style="width:8%;">⚡</th><th style="width:35%;">Command</th><th style="width:30%;">What It Does</th><th style="width:27%;">Example</th></tr></thead>
