                <div class="info-box warning">
                    <h5>⚠️ CRITICAL: NetworkPolicy requires a CNI plugin that supports it</h5>
                    <p>Flannel does NOT enforce NetworkPolicy. Calico, Cilium, and Weave Net DO. Verify your CNI before relying on NetworkPolicy: <code>kubectl get pods -n kube-system | grep -E 'calico|cilium|weave'</code>. If you see only Flannel, your NetworkPolicies are stored but NOT enforced — all traffic flows freely regardless of your rules.</p>
