                <div class="info-box tip">
                    <h5>💡 CKS Exam Tip — API Server Manifest Editing</h5>
                    <p>When you edit <code>/etc/kubernetes/manifests/kube-apiserver.yaml</code>, the kubelet <strong>automatically restarts the API server</strong> within ~30 seconds. Your <code>kubectl</code> connection WILL drop. Wait 30-60 seconds and reconnect. Use <code>crictl ps | grep apiserver</code> on the node to confirm the new container is running. <strong>Always add BOTH the flag AND the volume mount</strong> — missing either means your configuration silently doesn't work.</p>
