            <section class="section-block" id="se-13">
                <h3 class="section-h">E.13 EncryptionConfiguration Reference YAML</h3>
                <p>Enables AES-CBC encryption for Secrets at rest in etcd. <strong>Must be placed on the control plane node and referenced from the API server manifest.</strong></p>
                <div class="code-block-wrapper">
