            <section class="section-block" id="se-15">
                <h3 class="section-h">E.15 Kustomize Overlay Structure (Base + Dev/Staging/Prod)</h3>
                <p>Recommended directory structure for managing easypj manifests across environments using Kustomize. <strong>Base contains the common configuration; overlays override per-environment values.</strong></p>
                <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                    <div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-lang">Bash — Kustomize directory structure</span></div>
                    <pre><code class="language-bash">easypj-k8s/
├── base/
│   ├── kustomization.yaml          # Lists all base resources
│   ├── namespace.yaml              # E.1
│   ├── rbac.yaml                   # E.2
│   ├── networkpolicies.yaml        # E.3
│   ├── secrets.yaml                # E.4 (use placeholders in base)
│   ├── configmap.yaml              # E.5
│   ├── deployment-easypj.yaml      # E.6
│   ├── service-easypj.yaml         # E.7
│   ├── statefulset-postgres.yaml   # E.8
│   └── ingress.yaml                # E.9
├── overlays/
│   ├── dev/
│   │   ├── kustomization.yaml      # namespace: easypj-dev, replicas: 1
│   │   └── patches/
│   │       └── deployment-patch.yaml
│   ├── staging/
│   │   ├── kustomization.yaml      # namespace: easypj-staging, replicas: 2
│   │   └── patches/
│   └── prod/
│       ├── kustomization.yaml      # namespace: easypj-prod, replicas: 3
│       └── patches/
│           ├── deployment-scale.yaml
│           └── ingress-domain.yaml

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
# Example: base/kustomization.yaml
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
apiVersion: kustomize.config.k8s.io/v1beta1
kind: Kustomization
namespace: easypj-prod
resources:
- namespace.yaml
- rbac.yaml
