- service-easypj.yaml
- statefulset-postgres.yaml
- ingress.yaml</code></pre>
                </div>

                <h4>Deployment Order — Apply These in Sequence</h4>
                <div class="process-steps">
                    <div class="step"><span class="step-number">1</span><strong>Namespace + PSS</strong><p><code>kubectl apply -f namespace.yaml</code> — creates the easypj-prod namespace with Restricted PSS enforcement.</p></div>
                    <div class="step"><span class="step-number">2</span><strong>RBAC</strong><p><code>kubectl apply -f rbac.yaml</code> — creates ServiceAccounts, Roles, and RoleBindings.</p></div>
                    <div class="step"><span class="step-number">3</span><strong>Secrets + ConfigMap</strong><p><code>kubectl apply -f secrets.yaml -f configmap.yaml</code> — configuration before applications.</p></div>
                    <div class="step"><span class="step-number">4</span><strong>NetworkPolicies</strong><p><code>kubectl apply -f networkpolicies.yaml</code> — secure the network BEFORE deploying pods.</p></div>
                    <div class="step"><span class="step-number">5</span><strong>PostgreSQL StatefulSet</strong><p><code>kubectl apply -f statefulset-postgres.yaml</code> — database must be running before the application.</p></div>
                    <div class="step"><span class="step-number">6</span><strong>Django Deployment + Service + Ingress</strong><p><code>kubectl apply -f deployment-easypj.yaml -f service-easypj.yaml -f ingress.yaml</code></p></div>
                    <div class="step"><span class="step-number">7</span><strong>Admission Control</strong><p><code>kubectl apply -f gatekeeper-registry-policy.yaml -f kyverno-policies.yaml</code> — enforced AFTER initial deployment to avoid chicken-and-egg issues.</p></div>
                    <div class="step"><span class="step-number">8</span><strong>Runtime Security</strong><p><code>kubectl apply -f configmap-falco-rules.yaml</code> — apply and restart Falco DaemonSet.</p></div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </article>
