                    <details><summary>Show Solution</summary><div class="eq-answer"><div class="eq-answer-label">Solution</div><pre><code class="language-bash">slsa-verifier verify-image ghcr.io/easypj/app@sha256:... --source-uri github.com/easypj/repo
# Verify output shows: builder ID, source commit, build timestamp</code></pre></div></details>
